Design entschieden: Option (a) - echte Inflation via FROM_STRUCT + inflate()-Routing fuer /List$/. Wird zusammen mit #49 umgesetzt.
Implemented (option a): IO::K8s::List::FROM_STRUCT added -- derives item type from the list's own Kind-minus-'List' + apiVersion via expand_class(), with item_class as a sibling-struct-key override for a bare 'kind: List' payload. Unresolvable item GVK dies with the standard 'Cannot resolve Kubernetes GVK' error (never a partial list). IO::K8s::inflate() now routes any kind matching /List\z/ straight to IO::K8s::List before expand_class(). t/44_list_api_version.t #46 section green, incl. the item_class-override test case using the sibling-key mechanism the test already assumed -- no test redesign needed. Changes updated. Full suite: prove -lr t/ -> 57 files, 4023 tests, all green.
